# from, but never ship them.
Pace Lodgix Logo White.png
Pace Lodgix Wordmark v2.png
# Guard, not a live exclusion. "Marketing Image.png" was sitting loose in this
# folder unlisted, i.e. 2MB of source artwork publicly downloadable from the
# site root. It has been moved up to 01-Businesses/PaceLodgix/. The line stays
# so that dropping the file back in here cannot silently republish it.
Marketing Image.png

# Internal notes. The Worker serves this whole folder, so anything dropped in
# here is public by default — keep working docs listed.
*.md

# Redesign preview page — not public.
#
# preview.css and preview.js are NO LONGER LISTED HERE, and that is deliberate
# rather than an oversight. They were renamed to redesign.css / redesign.js and
# promoted: index.html now loads both, so they MUST be served or the live site
# ships with no redesign styles and no feature-grid motion. Do not re-add them.
#
# preview.html stays blocked. It is the side-by-side comparison page, it is
# noindex, and it now renders the same design as index.html — publishing it
# would put a duplicate of the homepage on a second URL.
preview.html
